{
  "id": "greyline_industrial",
  "name": "GREYLINE INDUSTRIAL THEATER",

  "_comment": [
    "A 64-sector industrial theater. Strategic sectors are not Source maps: the",
    "battle profile chooses a battlefield appropriate to population and stage.",
    "The opening line is a zig-zag seam so every row starts with a real contested",
    "neutral sector touching both RED and BLU instead of a decorative dead zone.",
    "",
    "The 8x8 graph gives the campaign room to move without making an individual",
    "sector grindy; battle weight still scales with real attendance.",
    "",
    "                          IRON JUNCTION",
    "                         /             \\",
    "                   FOUNDRY 17         QUARRY",
    "                       |                 |",
    "                   RAIL YARD ------- RESERVOIR",
    "                       |                 |",
    "                    RED HQ            BLU HQ"
  ],

